WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.170
I wonder how much time has passed...

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:10.280
Since she forgot how to truly smile.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.790
Since she lost real happiness.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:20.130
Will there ever be a time when she
smiles from the heart again?

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:25.400
Will there ever be a time when she
feels happiness again?

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:08.290
<b>Fifth Hour: Kagura</b>

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:18.150
I came to ask how you feel.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.310
Huh?

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:20.920
How I feel?

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:25.760
Hirose-sama?

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:44.180
I was wondering where you were, Hirose-sama.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:45.210
Hinata-chan.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.320
Are you taking a walk?

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:50.730
Let me walk with you.

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:54.220
W-Wait, Hinata-chan.

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:56.760
I need to talk to Hayami-chan.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:58.060
Hinata-chan!

00:02:58.060 --> 00:02:59.420
Hinata-chan!

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.090
I like you!

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:04.260
I-I like you.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:07.330
I-I like you so much,
I don't know what to do!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:11.440
I can't be parted from you now.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:19.750
Because... I... I already...

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.030
What?

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:25.650
Hinata-chan... I...

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:36.400
Hayami-chan!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.870
Don't come near me again.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.000
Goodbye.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:47.710
Hayami-chan...

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:27.610
<b>Hinata</b>

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:27.610
<b>Takuma</b>

00:04:21.930 --> 00:04:25.060
It's not even that late in the morning,
and they're already together.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:26.250
They've gotten even closer

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:27.610
since they went to the
beach together, right?

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:30.050
They're showing off.

00:04:30.050 --> 00:04:31.990
I wonder what happened...

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:35.460
A summertime beach frees couples in love.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:37.620
No, it doesn't.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.840
What's with this picture?

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:43.980
Usagi-chan wants to be a manga illustrator.

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:45.900
Your picture sucks.

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:48.520
I have to be the best at everything

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:51.670
in the village, no matter what it is.

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.340
Stop it!

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:58.980
What are you doing to my
historic masterpiece?

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.510
Stop!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.940
Well, whatever.

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:14.130
Next time, I'll make a masterpiece
that surpasses that one!

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:16.200
Taking all that into account,

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:19.560
these two triangles must be equivalent.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.760
Two triangles must be equivalent when the

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.030
lengths of their sides match each other's...

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:24.670
When one of the triangle sides is

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:27.440
the same, while the angles are the same...

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.260
Hayami-chan.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.010
And when two sides are equal,

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.710
and their corresponding angles are equal.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:32.690
Did something happen to your notebook?

00:05:32.690 --> 00:05:36.000
This is pretty important,
so be sure to remember it.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.710
It will be on the test.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.650
H-Hirose-sama...

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:44.090
I forgot my eraser.
Could I borrow yours?

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.460
H-Hirose-sama?

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:49.890
Hirose-sama!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:52.860
Let's solve this problem using the

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:54.970
laws of equivalence we just learned.

00:05:57.860 --> 00:06:00.840
What are you doing, Kohinata-san?

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.350
If you don't feel like being here, then leave.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:21.390
Hayami-chan! Hayami-chan!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:24.960
Hirose-sama!

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:35.970
Oh, hello, Takuma-kun.

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:37.570
Hirose-sama.

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:40.810
Grandfather.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:44.400
Oh, Hinata. Good timing.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:48.650
Takuma-kun, would you like to
have dinner at our place?

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:51.860
I...

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.460
Th-That would be good.

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.700
Let's go.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.780
Hinata-chan!

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:11.280
So they drew both of you,
in your wedding clothes, on the blackboard.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.780
Hamaji-san and the others are a handful.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:18.120
Well, it may happen someday.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.680
I-I...

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:25.500
But I really am glad.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.360
Hmm?

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:30.230
Hinata has grown up

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:32.620
in this household, without any problems,

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.550
but she was a lot of trouble in the past.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.000
I was worried how she would
turn out in the future,

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:42.930
but now that I know she's met someone
like you, I can relax.

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:47.320
Please continue to stay with her.

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.010
R-Right.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:53.070
Anyway, that's enough seriousness
for the evening.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.020
Eat up, Hirose-sama.

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:58.190
Oh, I mean Takuma-kun.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:00.480
Eat up.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.470
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:44.540
<i>It's nice to eat cup noodles outside.</i>

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.140
<i>I know! I'll talk to myself.</i>

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:53.440
<i>It's sad, not being able to talk
to friends at school.</i>

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:35.210
It looks like my grandfather really likes you.

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:39.360
Hinata-chan.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:39.960
Yes?

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:42.590
Why are you doing this?

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:44.430
This?

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.480
Is your grandfather trying

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.460
to find a way into the
Hirose household?

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.940
And to that end, is he
trying to make you...

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.360
I like you!

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.410
I like you... I like you!

00:09:56.970 --> 00:10:00.110
But Hinata-chan, you look sad.

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:12.860
Did you take him home?

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:14.290
Yes.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:18.860
The Hirose family has a long history.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:22.230
They're deeply involved with our
country's internal workings.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:27.400
If we can make our way into their family,
the Kagura family will be...

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:32.240
Tomorrow is Sunday.

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:35.440
Invite Hirose-sama out and
have fun somewhere.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.410
How about the town?

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:38.220
Grandfather!

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:44.520
I... I don't want to do this anymore...

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:47.250
Hotaru is dead!

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:50.430
You understand what this means,
don't you Hinata?

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.370
Yes, Grandfather.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:06.740
He's not here?

00:11:06.740 --> 00:11:11.500
No... Damn, that kid skipped
out on you, didn't he?

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.230
Leave it to me, miss.

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.750
Leave that failure of a nephew to me.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:21.790
No, that's not it.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:25.630
We didn't have plans or anything...

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.740
Hinata-chan's grandfather?

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:36.360
Yeah.

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:38.550
I was wondering if you remembered anything.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:43.320
Like if anything happened with Hinata-chan...

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:46.120
Is there something?

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:52.640
Yeah, but...

00:11:52.640 --> 00:11:56.190
Please tell me, Hamaji-chan!

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:02.960
I'll tell you... But only because you're special.

00:12:06.210 --> 00:12:08.950
Long ago, there was a period of time

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.700
when Hinata-chan and Kohinata-san

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:13.880
were really close to each other.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:15.800
Yeah, I know.

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:19.830
We were all surprised.

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:23.590
But she's the granddaughter of
the Kagura family, you know?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:25.590
The villagers, or the teachers,

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:27.860
couldn't say anything about it.

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:33.160
Yui-chan got all worked up by herself, though.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:19.420
<i>Here.</i>

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:23.210
<i>Candy tastes like happiness.</i>

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.830
<i>When you lick it...</i>

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.150
<i>Flowers bloom in your mouth, right?</i>

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:39.330
But... One night...

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.290
There was a line of adults, all carrying torches,

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:45.200
as far as the eye could see.

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.110
My dad went out, too,

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:51.200
because Hinata-chan's
grandfather told him to.

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:54.210
They said they were going to
rid the town of a demon.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:13:59.850
<i>Save me!</i>

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:03.590
<i>You must not damage
the name of Kagura Hinata.</i>

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.680
<i>Hinata-chan! Hinata-chan!</i>

00:14:19.970 --> 00:14:21.910
<i>Hinata-chan! Hinata-chan!</i>

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.640
<i>Do you understand now?</i>

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:29.790
<i>Do you understand what will
happen if you associate</i>

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.280
<i>with a Kohinata family member?</i>

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:37.560
<i>This is something that
you brought upon them.</i>

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.130
<i>When you got close to that girl,</i>

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:43.560
<i>it brought misfortune upon all
the people of this village.</i>

00:14:43.560 --> 00:14:44.920
<i>But...</i>

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:47.360
<i>Are you not Hinata?</i>

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:50.730
<i>Is Kagura Hinata not a good girl?</i>

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:55.410
<i>Would Hinata — a good
girl — not listen to me?</i>

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:11.220
The next day, the two stopped
talking to each other.

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:27.300
Kagura, do you really like Hirose?

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.630
I-I do.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:36.950
I really... I really do like him a lot!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:44.320
I see.

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:46.660
He's a nice guy.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:49.210
I hope you're happy together.

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:01.410
Takuma-kun!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:06.570
A successful landing!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:08.910
Ten points! Ten points! Ten points!

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:10.050
Yay!

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:11.790
Clap clap! Whee!

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:15.350
Um, well...

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:23.500
I see. You really are at a
tough age, Takuma-kun...

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:33.830
I'm pretty sure Hinata-chan
only got close to me

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:34.470
<b>Hirose
Family
Funeral</b>

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:36.960
because her grandfather told her to.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:41.250
The same reason she stopped
talking to Hayami-chan...

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:45.230
I wonder why she listens to him.

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:49.450
She has to. He's her grandfather.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.480
You listen to what your grandfather has to say?

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:54.110
What about your grandmother?

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.870
Don't make light of the situation.

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:59.630
It's her family. She might get into
a fight with her grandfather!

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.080
That's...

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:04.630
But she's not happy, right?

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:10.170
If you hide your real feelings,
you can't be truly happy.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.440
If she fights with her grandfather,

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:14.940
that means she wouldn't be hiding her feelings.

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:20.640
I wonder if you have to hide
how you feel from your family.

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:24.890
Spirits don't have families, so I wouldn't know!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:31.460
She should just say how she feels.
Don't you think, Promised One?

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:40.700
Excellent work, Hinata.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.670
I hear that the Kohinata girl

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:46.140
won't even talk to Hirose-sama anymore.

00:17:46.140 --> 00:17:49.580
Now there's no one left in our way.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:54.250
Make the Hirose boy ours,
no matter what you have to do.

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:28.120
<i>But Hinata-chan, you look sad.</i>

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.020
<i>He's a nice guy.</i>

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.220
<i>I hope you're happy together.</i>

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:43.880
H-Hirose-sama!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.560
You surprised me.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:46.940
How long have you been there?

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:51.120
But I'm happy you decided to come
and see me on your own...

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:53.300
Let's go, Hinata-chan.

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:56.110
Where...

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:57.850
To see Hayami-chan.

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:00.690
T-To do what?

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:03.000
You should stop lying.

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:06.390
What are you saying?

00:19:06.390 --> 00:19:08.760
Why are we going to see Kohinata-san?

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:13.410
O-Oh, I know! How about we eat?

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:16.300
I'll make fried egg again.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.400
H-Hirose-sama!

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:26.660
Th-That hurts, Hirose-sama...

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.680
Hirose-sama!

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:30.740
I can't! Forgive me!

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:31.480
We're going.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:34.960
No! I can't do it,
even if you're the one asking me!

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:36.860
Hinata-chan, we're going.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:39.460
My grandfather will get mad at me!

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:40.720
On the other side of this bridge...

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.030
She's not a demon!

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:45.890
She's not a demon.

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:48.230
You know what's on the other side...

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:51.990
You know that your friend is over there!

00:20:02.210 --> 00:20:03.750
What is this...

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:27.320
<i>Did you get yelled at again?</i>

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:34.980
<i>I-I'm a bad girl. I'm a bad girl,
so my grandfather...</i>

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:37.600
<i>Why are you a bad girl?</i>

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:40.380
<i>Because I keep messing up.</i>

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:45.180
<i>Kagura children must be good and
must be able to do anything...</i>

00:20:45.190 --> 00:20:48.880
<i>But I...</i>

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:49.790
<i>It doesn't matter.</i>

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:55.700
<i>It doesn't matter if you're
a good girl or not.</i>

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:57.650
<i>You're you.</i>

00:20:58.550 --> 00:21:02.970
<i>You're my friend, Hinata.</i>

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:22.490
Kohinata-san...

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:24.430
Kohinata-san!

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.450
I'm sorry!

00:21:45.180 --> 00:21:46.800
I'm sorry...

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:49.950
Hayami-chan...

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:06.060
I heard, candy tastes like happiness.

00:22:10.740 --> 00:22:14.620
And when you lick it, it's like
flowers bloom in your mouth,

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:16.780
Hinata.

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:22.720
Hayami-chan...

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:02.320
I'll explain!

00:24:02.320 --> 00:24:04.270
When Otoha and Takuma do a spirit-fusion,

00:24:04.270 --> 00:24:06.670
they become the spirit-robot Ototakumaizer!

00:24:06.670 --> 00:24:09.460
And if they do a super spirit-fusion
with Hayami's gondola,

00:24:09.460 --> 00:24:12.940
they evolve into Ototakumaizer Great!

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:15.030
<b>Sixth Hour: Yui</b>

00:24:12.940 --> 00:24:15.000
I don't know what to say.
